And if we actually went and plotted out this data,

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:33.040
just with a straight L linear model,

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:35.380
sales to disposable income,

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:36.420
we're like looking at this

