It made them better, but not perfect, right?

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:35.000
So, we call this the first harmonic.

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:37.660
And if we add another curve, it's the second harmonic.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.500
And if it's the third one, it's the third harmonic.

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:42.460
And so, you have to remember these things are repeating

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:46.300
over time, again and again and again,

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:50.300
on whatever frequency we want them to repeat upon.

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:51.140
So that...

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:55.300
This looks better.

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:57.940
It's not quite under, under, up, under, under, up,

